message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names. See "Citation metadata" in CONTRIBUTING.md for who is an
  author and how to add or correct your entry.
title: Cloud Components
abstract: >-
  Cloud Components are lightweight, fast and reusable web components by the
  ELIXIR Cloud & AAI community for managing and accessing GA4GH and ELIXIR
  cloud services, such as the GA4GH Service Registry, TES, WES, TRS and DRS
  APIs, published as npm packages and usable with any web framework.
